      "general": {
        "abstract": "The Darss-Zingster Bodden is a tideless flat brackish inner coastal water of the Southern Baltic Sea. It consists of 4 consecutive water basins connected by narrow streams. This forms a gradient of salinity from 1-14 PSU and a eutrophication gradient.",
